Pixel Knight
============

This file covers two different things under two different licences. Read the
scope note before the MIT text below, because the artwork is not mine to give
away and the MIT licence does not reach it.


SOURCE CODE
-----------

The MIT licence at the bottom of this file applies to the source code of this
extension: `src/`, `media/companion.js`, `media/icon.svg`, and the build and
configuration files at the repository root.


ARTWORK  --  NOT COVERED BY THE MIT LICENCE
-------------------------------------------

Everything under `media/tiny-swords/` is the "Tiny Swords" pack by Pixel Frog:

    https://pixelfrog-assets.itch.io/tiny-swords

That artwork remains the copyright of its author and is used here under the
terms published on the page above. Those terms permit use in personal and
commercial projects and permit modification, but they also state:

    "You may not redistribute, resell, or repackage the assets, even if the
    files are modified."

Nothing in the MIT licence below grants you any right whatsoever to that
artwork. If you fork this repository, vendor its code, or reuse any part of it,
you must obtain the pack yourself from the link above and comply with its terms
directly. Crediting Pixel Frog is not required by those terms, but it is
welcomed by the author and this project does it in the README.


